# This fork keeps a customized README.md (Warm Floor / Boost mentions).
# When merging updates in from the upstream mirror branch, always keep our
# version instead of taking upstream's - never overwrite it, never leave a
# conflict to resolve here. Requires the "ours" driver to be registered
# locally (see CONTRIBUTING.md / git config merge.ours.driver true) - this
# is a per-clone git config setting that .gitattributes alone can't carry.
README.md merge=ours
